dy na poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED nemovitosti a \\u017Eivotn\\xED rezervu (ide\\xE1ln\\u011B n\\u011Bkolik m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xEDch spl\\xE1tek).\",\"Pokud jste OSV\\u010C, banky \\u010Dasto pracuj\\xED s da\\u0148ov\\xFDm z\\xE1kladem nebo specifick\\xFDm p\\u0159epo\\u010Dtem \\u2014 viz t\\xE9ma Hypot\\xE9ka OSV\\u010C.\"]},{id:\"dalsi-krok\",heading:\"Rozumn\\xFD dal\\u0161\\xED krok\",paragraphs:[\"A\\u017E budete m\\xEDt realistick\\xFD strop spl\\xE1tky, ov\\u011B\\u0159te p\\u0159ipravenost dokument\\u016F a LTV. Teprve potom d\\xE1v\\xE1 smysl srovn\\xE1vat konkr\\xE9tn\\xED nab\\xEDdky p\\u0159es partnera.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Sta\\u010D\\xED hrub\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem z v\\xFDplatn\\xED p\\xE1sky?\",answer:\"Ne. Banka hodnot\\xED \\u010Dist\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem a z\\xE1vazky. U OSV\\u010C z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na dokl\\xE1d\\xE1n\\xED a intern\\xEDch pravidlech banky \\u2014 nejde o jednotn\\xFD vzorec.\"},{question:\"Je v\\xFDsledek z webu z\\xE1vazn\\xFD?\",answer:\"Ne. Jde o model a edukaci. Schv\\xE1len\\xED v\\u017Edy z\\xE1vis\\xED na bance, odhadu nemovitosti a kompletn\\xED dokumentaci.\"}],sources:[{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika (LTV/DTI/DSTI)\",url:CNB_MACRO,note:\"Prim\\xE1rn\\xED zdroj limity v \\u010Dase; ov\\u011B\\u0159te aktu\\xE1ln\\xED zn\\u011Bn\\xED.\"},{label:\"Metodika dat Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika},{label:\"Akademie: DSTI\",url:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/dsti`}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Zjistit moje mo\\u017Enosti\",href:import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti},{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"Regulace a investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky v \\u010CR\",href:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/regulace-investicni-hypoteky-cr`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"DSTI\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/dsti`},{label:\"DTI\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/dti`}]},{slug:\"hypoteka-do-36-let\",title:\"Hypot\\xE9ka do 36 let \\u2014 v\\u011Bkov\\xE9 limity, LTV a co se m\\u011Bn\\xED\",description:\"Jak v\\u011Bk \\u017Eadatele ovliv\\u0148uje splatnost, LTV a \\u017Eivotn\\xED poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED. Edukace k doporu\\u010Den\\xEDm \\u010CNB \\u2014 bez marketingov\\xFDch slib\\u016F \\u201Ev\\xFDhody pro mlad\\xE9\\u201C.\",h1:\"Hypot\\xE9ka do 36 let\",lead:\"V\\u011Bk \\u017Eadatele ovliv\\u0148uje maxim\\xE1ln\\xED splatnost a n\\u011Bkdy i limity LTV. Nejprve pochopte pravidla, pak teprve srovn\\xE1vejte \\u201Eakce pro mlad\\xE9\\u201C.\",audience:\"\\u017Dadatel\\xE9 do cca 36 let a p\\xE1ry, kde jeden partner limity posouv\\xE1.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-07-21\",sections:[{id:\"vek-a-splatnost\",heading:\"V\\u011Bk a maxim\\xE1ln\\xED splatnost\",paragraphs:[\"Banky typicky nastavuj\\xED konec splatnosti tak, aby \\xFAv\\u011Br dob\\u011Bhl p\\u0159ed ur\\u010Dit\\xFDm v\\u011Bkem klienta. Mlad\\u0161\\xED \\u017Eadatel m\\xE1 del\\u0161\\xED horizont \\u2014 to samo o sob\\u011B nesni\\u017Euje \\xFArok, ale m\\u016F\\u017Ee sn\\xED\\u017Eit m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xED spl\\xE1tku p\\u0159i stejn\\xE9m LTV.\",\"U spole\\u010Dn\\xFDch \\u017E\\xE1dost\\xED rozhoduje \\u010Dasto star\\u0161\\xED \\u017Eadatel. \\u201EDo 36 let\\u201C proto nen\\xED marketingov\\xFD \\u0161t\\xEDtek, ale praktick\\xFD parametr modelu. Pokud je partnerovi 45 a v\\xE1m 30, limity splatnosti se obvykle \\u0159\\xEDd\\xED star\\u0161\\xEDm \\u017Eadatelem.\"]},{id:\"ltv-ramce\",heading:\"LTV a doporu\\u010Den\\xED \\u010CNB\",paragraphs:[\"Makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED limity LTV se v \\u010Dase m\\u011Bn\\xED a mohou rozli\\u0161ovat skupiny \\u017Eadatel\\u016F. V\\u017Edy ov\\u011B\\u0159te aktu\\xE1ln\\xED doporu\\u010Den\\xED \\u010CNB a intern\\xED praxi banky \\u2014 webov\\xFD model je orienta\\u010Dn\\xED.\",\"Vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED LTV znamen\\xE1 vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED riziko pro banku i pro v\\xE1s: men\\u0161\\xED pol\\u0161t\\xE1\\u0159 p\\u0159i poklesu ceny nemovitosti a \\u010Dasto p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED. Ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED akontace tak\\xE9 \\u010Dast\\u011Bji znamen\\xE1 hor\\u0161\\xED sazbov\\xE9 p\\xE1smo.\"],bullets:[\"Nejd\\u0159\\xEDv spo\\u010D\\xEDtejte pot\\u0159ebnou akontaci.\",\"Pak teprve porovn\\xE1vejte sazby \\u2014 LTV p\\xE1smo sazbu \\u010Dasto ovlivn\\xED v\\xEDc ne\\u017E \\u201Eakce\\u201C.\",\"Rezerva na not\\xE1\\u0159e, katastr a st\\u011Bhov\\xE1n\\xED nepat\\u0159\\xED do \\u201Ezbyl\\xE9 akontace\\u201C v inzer\\xE1tu.\"]},{id:\"pojisteni-a-dokumenty\",heading:\"Poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED a dokumenty\",paragraphs:[\"Del\\u0161\\xED splatnost zvy\\u0161uje celkov\\xFD \\xFArok zaplacen\\xFD p\\u0159es \\u017Eivot \\xFAv\\u011Bru \\u2014 i kdy\\u017E je m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xED spl\\xE1tka ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED. Poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED schopnosti spl\\xE1cet nebo \\u017Eivotn\\xED poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt podm\\xEDnkou banky; porovnejte, zda ho pot\\u0159ebujete jinde levn\\u011Bji.\",\"P\\u0159ipravenost dokument\\u016F (p\\u0159\\xEDjem, z\\xE1vazky, odhad) zkr\\xE1t\\xED \\u010Das k nab\\xEDdce v\\xEDc ne\\u017E hled\\xE1n\\xED \\u201Eakce pro mlad\\xE9\\u201C bez \\u010D\\xEDsel.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"M\\xE1m automaticky n\\xE1rok na vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED LTV?\",answer:\"Ne. Limity a v\\xFDjimky z\\xE1vis\\xED na aktu\\xE1ln\\xEDm r\\xE1mci \\u010CNB a metodice banky. V\\u011Bk je jeden z faktor\\u016F, ne z\\xE1ruka.\"},{question:\"Vyplat\\xED se v\\u017Edy maxim\\xE1ln\\xED splatnost?\",answer:\"Ne nutn\\u011B. Del\\u0161\\xED splatnost sni\\u017Euje spl\\xE1tku, ale zvy\\u0161uje celkov\\xFD \\xFArok a dobu rizika. Modelujte oba sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159e.\"}],sources:[{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika\",url:CNB_MACRO},{label:\"Akademie: LTV\",url:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/ltv`},{label:\"Metodika\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru},{label:\"Zjistit moje mo\\u017Enosti\",href:import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"\\xDArokov\\xE9 sazby hypot\\xE9k 2026 \\u2014 kontext\",href:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/urokove-sazby-hypotek-2026`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"LTV\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/ltv`},{label:\"Fixace\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/fixace`}]},{slug:\"koupe-vs-najem\",title:\"Koup\\u011B vs. n\\xE1jem \\u2014 rozhodovac\\xED model, ne ideologie\",description:\"Kdy d\\xE1v\\xE1 smysl koupit a kdy z\\u016Fstat v n\\xE1jmu: horizont, n\\xE1klady, sazby a rezerva. Orienta\\u010Dn\\xED model s viditeln\\xFDmi p\\u0159edpoklady.\",h1:\"Koup\\u011B vs. n\\xE1jem\",lead:\"Nejde o mor\\xE1ln\\xED ot\\xE1zku \\u201Evlastnit = vyhr\\xE1t\\u201C. Jde o cash-flow, horizont bydlen\\xED, n\\xE1klady na \\xFAv\\u011Br a to, co se stane, kdy\\u017E sazby nebo ceny p\\u016Fjdou proti v\\xE1m.\",audience:\"Lid\\xE9 rozhoduj\\xEDc\\xED se mezi n\\xE1jmem a prvn\\xED (nebo dal\\u0161\\xED) koup\\xED v \\u010CR.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-07-21\",sections:[{id:\"promenne\",heading:\"Kl\\xED\\u010Dov\\xE9 prom\\u011Bnn\\xE9\",paragraphs:[\"Horizont bydlen\\xED, akontace, sazba, inflace n\\xE1jmu, n\\xE1klady na \\xFAdr\\u017Ebu a da\\u0148ov\\xE9 aspekty. Kr\\xE1tk\\xFD horizont \\u010Dasto favorizuje n\\xE1jem \\u2014 i kdy\\u017E \\u201Ev\\u0161ichni kupuj\\xED\\u201C.\",\"Kalkula\\u010Dka koup\\u011B vs. n\\xE1jem ukazuje citlivost na p\\u0159edpoklady. Zm\\u011B\\u0148te je z\\xE1m\\u011Brn\\u011B, a\\u0165 nevid\\xEDte jen jeden p\\u0159\\xEDb\\u011Bh. Optimistic defaulty z marketingu do modelu nepat\\u0159\\xED.\"]},{id:\"rizika\",heading:\"Rizika, kter\\xE1 se v marketingu ztr\\xE1cej\\xED\",paragraphs:[\"Pokles ceny, r\\u016Fst sazeb po fixaci, v\\xFDm\\u011Bna kotle, SVJ fond oprav. N\\xE1jem m\\xE1 riziko v\\xFDpov\\u011Bdi a r\\u016Fstu n\\xE1jmu \\u2014 ale ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED v\\xE1zan\\xFD kapit\\xE1l.\",\"Pokud nem\\xE1te rezervu na 3\\u20136 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F spl\\xE1tek a oprav, koup\\u011B na hran\\u011B DSTI je spekulace, ne \\u201Ejistota st\\u0159echy\\u201C.\"]},{id:\"rozhodnuti\",heading:\"Jak rozhodnout bez ideologie\",paragraphs:[\"Sepi\\u0161te horizont, maxim\\xE1ln\\xED komfortn\\xED spl\\xE1tku a alternativn\\xED v\\xFDnos kapit\\xE1lu (co byste d\\u011Blali s akontac\\xED jinak). Teprve pak spus\\u0165te model a hypot\\xE9\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Je koup\\u011B v\\u017Edy lep\\u0161\\xED investice?\",answer:\"Ne. Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na horizontu, n\\xE1kladech \\xFAv\\u011Bru a alternativn\\xEDm v\\xFDnosu kapit\\xE1lu. Modelujte, neopakujte fr\\xE1ze.\"},{question:\"Kdy n\\xE1jem d\\xE1v\\xE1 v\\u011Bt\\u0161\\xED smysl?\",answer:\"Typicky p\\u0159i kr\\xE1tk\\xE9m horizontu, nejist\\xE9 lokalit\\u011B, n\\xEDzk\\xE9 rezerv\\u011B nebo kdy\\u017E by LTV/DSTI tla\\u010Dily spl\\xE1tku nad komfortn\\xED strop.\"}],sources:[{label:\"Kalkula\\u010Dka koup\\u011B vs. n\\xE1jem\",url:import_routes.routes.kalkulacky.koupeVsNajem},{label:\"Metodika model\\u016F\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Kalkula\\u010Dka koup\\u011B vs. n\\xE1jem\",href:import_routes.routes.kalkulacky.koupeVsNajem},{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"\\xDArokov\\xE9 sazby hypot\\xE9k \\u2014 kontext\",href:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/urokove-sazby-hypotek-2026`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"RPSN\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/rpsn`}]},{slug:\"hypoteka-v-zahranici\",title:\"Hypot\\xE9ka v zahrani\\u010D\\xED \\u2014 cesty financov\\xE1n\\xED a rizika\",description:\"Jak \\u010Ce\\u0161i financuj\\xED n\\xE1kup v zahrani\\u010D\\xED: lok\\xE1ln\\xED hypot\\xE9ka, \\u010Desk\\xE9 zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED, hotovost. Hub